GIMP Palette
Name: VisualNovel — Twilight Study
Columns: 5
#
# Direction: one room, one lamp, dusk outside the window. The quietest palette
# here, because this is the only game where the player is reading and every
# saturated pixel is competing with the text.
#
# It is also the only palette with a skin ramp, which is the reason it exists
# separately at all: portraits are the entire visual budget of a visual novel,
# and a face painted out of a generic warm ramp looks like a prop. Three steps
# is enough for a bust at this size — shadow, body, and the lit edge facing the
# lamp.
#
# lamp-* and night-* are the room's two light sources and they oppose each
# other on purpose: warm from inside, cool from the window. A portrait lit by
# both has somewhere to sit between them, which is what makes a flat bust read
# as being *in* the room rather than pasted onto it.
#
 26  26  26	outline
 32  28  44	room-0-shadow
 56  48  72	room-1
 86  74 106	room-2
